WeightXReps Rust client

Usage: wxrust [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     
  show     
  fetch    
  table    
  heatmap  
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --credentials <CREDENTIALS>  
  -a, --force-authentication       
      --no-network                 
      --no-cache                   
      --no-cache-write             
      --color <COLOR>              [default: auto]
  -v, --verbose                    
  -h, --help                       Print help
